  skos:scopeNote "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 - Annex XIII 2 (c). Restricted: Only to persons with legitimate interests, notified bodies, MS authorities and COM. EV: Mandatory, LMT: Mandatory, Industrial: Mandatory."@en;
  skos:definition """Dismantling information, including at least: 
- exploded diagrams of the battery system/pack showing the location of battery cells, 
- disassembly sequences, 
- type and number of fastening techniques to be unlocked, 
- tools required for disassembly, 
- warnings if risk of damaging parts exist, 
- amount of cells used and layout 
[a web link]"""@en;
  dct:accessRights dpptype:restrictedType, battype:batteryRestrictedType1 .

